    "overview": "Experience powerful entertainment with the Intex Raag 2200 Party Speaker, designed to bring energy and excitement to every party, celebration and karaoke session. With 220W powerful sound, it delivers an immersive audio experience suitable for both indoor and outdoor entertainment. The speaker features multimode front RGB lights that create a vibrant party atmosphere, while the dual UHF cordless karaoke microphones with display make singing and hosting convenient and engaging. With TWS connectivity, you can pair compatible speakers for a wider sound experience. The built-in mic-to-USB/TF recording feature lets you record your karaoke sessions, while up to 5 hours of playback time helps keep the entertainment going for longer. Whether you're hosting a party, enjoying karaoke with friends, or creating a lively home entertainment setup, the Intex Raag 2200 is built to make every moment more exciting.",
